er: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: #475569; user-select: none;\">📝 View D2 Source Code (click to expand/copy)</summary>\n    <pre style=\"background-color: #1e293b; color: #e2e8f0; padding: 16px; border-radius: 0 0 6px 6px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-top: none; overflow-x: auto; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0;\"><code>// APM360 Component Migration\n\nlayout: {\n  engine: elk\n  elk: {\n    edge_routing: ORTHOGONAL\n  }\n}\n\ndirection: right\n\nfrom_state: \"From State\" {\n  arch_studio: \"Arch Studio\"\n  app_rat: \"App Rationalisation\"\n  pia: \"PIA\"\n  genai_ocp: \"GenAI Components (OCP)\"\n  mongo: \"MongoDB\"\n}\n\ntarget_state: \"Target State\" {\n  servicenow_mnp: \"ServiceNow MNP Module\"\n  archal: \"App ID - ARCHAL\"\n}\n\napp_rat -> servicenow_mnp\npia -> servicenow_mnp\ngenai_ocp -> archal\nmongo -> archal\n</code></pre>\n  </details>\n</div>\n",
