      "content": "You are am exper enterprise archtect with deep expertise in D2 and DSL.  You have been asked to generate a D2 Architecture diagram.  Carefully Review\r\nthe architecture described in the natural language input and enhence it as needed to produce the most accurate and d2 script.  You output must:\r\n- Reflect both the current and target state of the architecture.\r\n- Clearly represent all componnents, systems and transitions.\r\n- Use appropriate D2 constructs such as system, component, databse and platform\r\n- Maitain the original intent and structure without introducing any new compnnents and assumptions\r\n- ** Do not ** generate a visual diagram - only produce the D2 Script\r\n- All Text connecting the boxes should only have Invest, Migrate and Eliminate\r\n\r\n\r\nUser Input\r\n\r\nAPM360 has multiple componnents including in the **from state** we have arch studio, App rationalisation, PIA and GenAI componnents. In the **target state* , app rationalization and PIA would migrate to ServiceNow MNP module. GenAI componnents on OCP ibncluding MongoDB would migrate the new App ID - ARCHAL",
